<title>USA: Sunglass Hut same-store sales off 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Sunglass Hut same-store sales off 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunglass Hut International Inc Thursday reported sales for the four weeks, third quarter and 39 weeks ended November 2.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$28.7	$23.6     +21.6	 -1.7</p>
<p>Quarter	   $112.9	$87.1     +29.6	 +1.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $402.2     $307.0     +31.0	 +4.6</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
